      "text": "Retry policy\nmax_retry_count defaults to 2.\nInitial attempt + up to 2 retries.\nBoth validation failures and execution errors\nroute back to generate_sql while budget remains.",
      "originalText": "Retry policy\nmax_retry_count defaults to 2.\nInitial attempt + up to 2 retries.\nBoth validation failures and execution errors\nroute back to generate_sql while budget remains.",
